{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And he shall have no inheritance.</b> This is the inheritance of the other nations, namely the inheritance of other peoples — they are the Kenite, the Kenizzite, and the Kadmonite. <b>In the midst of his brethren.</b> This is the inheritance of five, that is, five brethren — for the sons of Leah were six, and Levi had five brothers from the same father and mother. <b>YHWH is his inheritance.</b> For he was tenth among the sons, from bottom to top, as I mentioned in the section of ויקח קרח, and therefore it says, יהוה הוא נחלתו — HaShem is his inheritance; and from this He gave him the tithe."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:49:04.306906078Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}